innerHTML: " FALSE "
innerText: "FALSE"

SERVER: <inside td>
innerHTML: "HTML("&lt;p class="bg-danger"&gt; FALSE &lt;/p&gt;")"
innerText: "HTML("<p class="bg-danger"> FALSE </p>")"

Any suggestions on how to get the css to take hold?

Thanks, Stephen...

