You can also use

renderUI({
  tags$iframe(id = 'app', src = url(), width = '100%')
})

It is a better solution than constructing the HTML code manually,
especially when the URL contains special HTML entities.

Regards,
Yihui

On Thu, Mar 12, 2015 at 3:50 AM, cho7tom <t.fi...@gmail.com> wrote:
