Really, I'm iterating through a list of the addresses in the file and making a Google Geocoder API call each time. Currently the app uses server-side geocoding, but I would like to move to client-side geocoding <https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/javascript/examples/geocoding-simple> so that more people can use the tool.

