> checkboxInput). That said, I don't think it's possible to do something like
> search = list(regex = input$user_regex), where input$user_regex is TRUE or
> FALSE depending on the value of a checkboxInput. Is there some other way to
> let the user toggle searching by regex?
>
> Thanks!

