Are you saying that this doesn't run on Shiny Server? If so, make sure that the packages are not only installed, but installed either in the machine-wide library OR as the user who is actually going to run the app (by default this is an account named "shiny"). If you just log in with your regular SSH account and install, then you'll just be installing it in your own personal library.

Switch to either root:
sudo su -

or shiny:
sudo su - shiny

Then launch R and install the packages you want.

