Hi,

You can get a scrollable wellpanel like this:

wellPanel(id = "tPanel",
               style = "overflow:scroll; overflow-y: hidden",
               whatever-you-want-to-put-inside)

In this case, it is only scrollable in the x-direction but modify the css accordingly.

Carlos

